          },
          {
           "title": "Disposable Contacts",
           "href": "/eyeglasses-contacts/contact-lenses/disposable-contacts/",
           "summary": "Disposable contact lenses are generally considered to be far superior in comfort and wearability than hard and rigid lenses.",
           "image": "https://da4e1j5r7gw87.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/sites/3016/2019/02/Thumbnail-dispoasable.jpg",
           "imageAlt": "Thumbnail dispoasable"
          },
          {
           "title": "Eye Exams for Contact Lenses",
           "href": "/eyeglasses-contacts/contact-lenses/eye-exams-for-contact-lenses/",
           "summary": "A routine exam won’t provide some of the measurements and testing that are required to determine if your eyes are suitable for contact lens wear, and to generate your contact lens Rx.",
           "image": "https://da4e1j5r7gw87.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/sites/3016/2019/01/Thumbnail-contact-exam.jpg",
           "imageAlt": "Thumbnail contact exam"
          },
          {
           "title": "Bifocal and Multifocal Contact Lenses",
           "href": "/eyeglasses-contacts/contact-lenses/bifocal-and-multifocal-contact-lenses/",
           "summary": "Fortunately for those who don’t like the look, feel or inconvenience of reading glasses, there is another option. Bifocal and multifocal lenses are also available in contact lenses in both soft and rigid varieties.",
           "image": "https://da4e1j5r7gw87.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/sites/3016/2019/01/Thumbnail-contacts-senior.jpg",
           "imageAlt": "Thumbnail contacts senior"
          },
          {
           "title": "Gas Permeable (GP) Contact Lenses",
           "href": "/eyeglasses-contacts/contact-lenses/gas-permeable-gp-contact-lenses/",
           "summary": "These rigid lenses aren’t as popular or well-known as soft lenses, but they offer the advantages of durability, crisp vision and high oxygen permeability.",
           "image": "https://da4e1j5r7gw87.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/sites/3016/2019/01/Thumbnail-contacts-3.jpg",
           "imageAlt": "Thumbnail contacts 3"
          },
          {
           "title": "Contact Lenses for the \"Hard-to-Fit\" Patient",
           "href": "/eyeglasses-contacts/contact-lenses/contact-lenses-for-the-hard-to-fit-patient/",
           "summary": "Challenges such as astigmatism, presbyopia, keratoconus and dry eyes needn’t be a barrier to contact lens wear, but they do require more time and patience.",
           "image": "https://da4e1j5r7gw87.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/sites/3016/2019/01/Thumbnail-contacts-4.jpg",
           "imageAlt": "Thumbnail contacts 4"
          },
          {
           "title": "Toric Contact Lenses for Astigmatism",
           "href": "/eyeglasses-contacts/contact-lenses/toric-contact-lenses-for-astigmatism/",
